My Emacs startup files.

AI-assisted reading
-------------------
C-c a e in code or Magit buffers prepares an explanation in agent-shell.
It uses the active region, otherwise the enclosing function/class or current
Magit hunk/file diff. Edit the question to request a review, then submit normally.
C-u starts a new shell; C-u C-u chooses an existing shell. Without a prefix,
agent-shell uses the most recently accessed shell in the project.
